{"task_id": "Mbpp/103", "solution": "def eulerian_num(n, m):\n    \"\"\"Returns the Eulerian number a(n, m) using the recurrence relation.\"\"\"\n    if m == 0 or m == n - 1:\n        return 1\n    if m < 0 or m >= n:\n        return 0\n    \n    # Use dynamic programming to build up the triangle\n    dp = [[0] * n for _ in range(n + 1)]\n    \n    # Base cases\n    for i in range(n + 1):\n        if i > 0:\n            dp[i][0] = 1\n            if i - 1 < i:\n                dp[i][i - 1] = 1\n    \n    # Fill the triangle using recurrence: A(n,m) = (m+1)*A(n-1,m) + (n-m)*A(n-1,m-1)\n    for i in range(2, n + 1):\n        for j in range(1, i - 1):\n            dp[i][j] = (j + 1) * dp[i - 1][j] + (i - j) * dp[i - 1][j - 1]\n    \n    return dp[n][m]"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/103", "solution": "def eulerian_num(n, m):\n    \"\"\"Returns the Eulerian number A(n,m) using the recurrence relation.\"\"\"\n    if m == 0 or m == n - 1:\n        return 1\n    if m < 0 or m >= n:\n        return 0\n    \n    # Create memoization table\n    dp = {}\n    \n    def helper(n, m):\n        if (n, m) in dp:\n            return dp[(n, m)]\n        \n        if m == 0 or m == n - 1:\n            result = 1\n        elif m < 0 or m >= n:\n            result = 0\n        else:\n            result = (m + 1) * helper(n - 1, m) + (n - m) * helper(n - 1, m - 1)\n        \n        dp[(n, m)] = result\n        return result\n    \n    return helper(n, m)"}
