{"task_id": "Mbpp/129", "solution": "def magic_square_test(matrix):\n    n = len(matrix)\n    if n == 0 or len(matrix[0]) != n:\n        return False\n    \n    target_sum = sum(matrix[0])\n    \n    for row in matrix:\n        if sum(row) != target_sum:\n            return False\n    \n    for col in range(n):\n        if sum(matrix[row][col] for row in range(n)) != target_sum:\n            return False\n    \n    if sum(matrix[i][i] for i in range(n)) != target_sum:\n        return False\n    \n    if sum(matrix[i][n-1-i] for i in range(n)) != target_sum:\n        return False\n    \n    return True"}
