{"task_id": "Mbpp/141", "solution": "def pancake_sort(arr):\n    \"\"\"Sorts array using pancake sort algorithm by repeatedly finding max and flipping.\"\"\"\n    def flip(arr, k):\n        return arr[:k+1][::-1] + arr[k+1:]\n    \n    n = len(arr)\n    for curr_size in range(n, 1, -1):\n        max_idx = arr[:curr_size].index(max(arr[:curr_size]))\n        if max_idx != curr_size - 1:\n            if max_idx != 0:\n                arr = flip(arr, max_idx)\n            arr = flip(arr, curr_size - 1)\n    return arr"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/141", "solution": "def pancake_sort(arr):\n    \"\"\"Sorts array using pancake sort algorithm by repeatedly flipping prefixes.\"\"\"\n    def flip(arr, k):\n        return arr[:k+1][::-1] + arr[k+1:]\n    \n    n = len(arr)\n    for curr_size in range(n, 1, -1):\n        max_idx = arr[:curr_size].index(max(arr[:curr_size]))\n        if max_idx != curr_size - 1:\n            if max_idx != 0:\n                arr = flip(arr, max_idx)\n            arr = flip(arr, curr_size - 1)\n    return arr"}
