{"task_id": "Mbpp/223", "solution": "def is_majority(arr, n, element):\n    # Find first occurrence of element\n    first = -1\n    for i in range(n):\n        if arr[i] == element:\n            first = i\n            break\n    \n    if first == -1:\n        return False\n    \n    # Check if element at position first + n//2 is same as element\n    if first + n // 2 < n and arr[first + n // 2] == element:\n        return True\n    \n    return False"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/223", "solution": "def is_majority(arr, n, element):\n    # Find first and last occurrence of element\n    first = -1\n    last = -1\n    \n    # Find first occurrence\n    for i in range(n):\n        if arr[i] == element:\n            first = i\n            break\n    \n    if first == -1:\n        return False\n    \n    # Find last occurrence\n    for i in range(n - 1, -1, -1):\n        if arr[i] == element:\n            last = i\n            break\n    \n    # Check if count is greater than n/2\n    count = last - first + 1\n    return count > n // 2"}
