{"task_id": "Mbpp/245", "solution": "def max_sum(arr):\n    \"\"\"Find maximum sum of bitonic subsequence (increasing then decreasing).\"\"\"\n    if not arr:\n        return 0\n    \n    n = len(arr)\n    \n    # Calculate maximum sum increasing subsequence ending at each index\n    inc = arr[:]\n    for i in range(1, n):\n        for j in range(i):\n            if arr[j] < arr[i]:\n                inc[i] = max(inc[i], inc[j] + arr[i])\n    \n    # Calculate maximum sum decreasing subsequence starting at each index\n    dec = arr[:]\n    for i in range(n - 2, -1, -1):\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            if arr[j] < arr[i]:\n                dec[i] = max(dec[i], dec[j] + arr[i])\n    \n    # Find maximum sum bitonic subsequence\n    max_sum_bitonic = 0\n    for i in range(n):\n        max_sum_bitonic = max(max_sum_bitonic, inc[i] + dec[i] - arr[i])\n    \n    return max_sum_bitonic"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/245", "solution": "def max_sum(arr):\n    \"\"\"Find maximum sum of bitonic subsequence (increasing then decreasing).\"\"\"\n    n = len(arr)\n    if n == 0:\n        return 0\n    if n == 1:\n        return arr[0]\n    \n    # Calculate maximum sum increasing subsequence ending at each index\n    inc = arr[:]\n    for i in range(1, n):\n        for j in range(i):\n            if arr[j] < arr[i]:\n                inc[i] = max(inc[i], inc[j] + arr[i])\n    \n    # Calculate maximum sum decreasing subsequence starting at each index\n    dec = arr[:]\n    for i in range(n - 2, -1, -1):\n        for j in range(i + 1, n):\n            if arr[i] > arr[j]:\n                dec[i] = max(dec[i], dec[j] + arr[i])\n    \n    # Find maximum sum bitonic subsequence\n    max_sum_val = 0\n    for i in range(n):\n        max_sum_val = max(max_sum_val, inc[i] + dec[i] - arr[i])\n    \n    return max_sum_val"}
