{"task_id": "Mbpp/286", "solution": "def max_sub_array_sum_repeated(arr, n, k):\n    def kadane(array):\n        max_ending_here = max_so_far = array[0]\n        for i in range(1, len(array)):\n            max_ending_here = max(array[i], max_ending_here + array[i])\n            max_so_far = max(max_so_far, max_ending_here)\n        return max_so_far\n    \n    if k == 1:\n        return kadane(arr)\n    \n    # Find max subarray sum in single array\n    single_max = kadane(arr)\n    \n    # Find max prefix and suffix sums\n    max_prefix = current_sum = arr[0]\n    for i in range(1, n):\n        current_sum += arr[i]\n        max_prefix = max(max_prefix, current_sum)\n    \n    max_suffix = current_sum = arr[n-1]\n    for i in range(n-2, -1, -1):\n        current_sum += arr[i]\n        max_suffix = max(max_suffix, current_sum)\n    \n    total_sum = sum(arr)\n    \n    if total_sum > 0:\n        return max(single_max, max_suffix + max_prefix + (k-2) * total_sum)\n    else:\n        return max(single_max, max_suffix + max_prefix)"}
