{"task_id": "Mbpp/300", "solution": "def count_binary_seq(n):\n    \"\"\"Returns count of binary sequences of length 2n where sum of first n bits equals sum of last n bits.\"\"\"\n    def nCr(n, r):\n        if r > n or r < 0:\n            return 0\n        if r == 0 or r == n:\n            return 1\n        result = 1\n        for i in range(min(r, n - r)):\n            result = result * (n - i) // (i + 1)\n        return result\n    \n    count = 0\n    for k in range(n + 1):\n        count += nCr(n, k) * nCr(n, k)\n    return float(count)"}
