{"task_id": "Mbpp/311", "solution": "def set_left_most_unset_bit(n):\n    \"\"\"Set the leftmost unset bit in the binary representation of n.\"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 1\n    \n    # Find the position of the leftmost set bit\n    temp = n\n    position = 0\n    while temp > 0:\n        temp >>= 1\n        position += 1\n    \n    # Check if the bit at position is already set\n    if n & (1 << position):\n        # If set, set the next bit to the left\n        return n | (1 << position)\n    else:\n        # If not set, set the bit at position\n        return n | (1 << (position - 1))"}
