{"task_id": "Mbpp/392", "solution": "def get_max_sum(n):\n    \"\"\"Returns maximum sum using f(n) = max(f(n/2) + f(n/3) + f(n/4) + f(n/5), n).\"\"\"\n    memo = {}\n    \n    def solve(num):\n        if num in memo:\n            return memo[num]\n        \n        if num == 0:\n            return 0\n        \n        divided_sum = solve(num // 2) + solve(num // 3) + solve(num // 4) + solve(num // 5)\n        result = max(divided_sum, num)\n        memo[num] = result\n        return result\n    \n    return solve(n)"}
