{"task_id": "Mbpp/721", "solution": "def maxAverageOfPath(grid):\n    n = len(grid)\n    memo = {}\n    \n    def dp(i, j):\n        if (i, j) in memo:\n            return memo[(i, j)]\n        \n        if i == n - 1 and j == n - 1:\n            return [(grid[i][j], 1)]\n        \n        paths = []\n        \n        if i + 1 < n:\n            for cost, length in dp(i + 1, j):\n                paths.append((cost + grid[i][j], length + 1))\n        \n        if j + 1 < n:\n            for cost, length in dp(i, j + 1):\n                paths.append((cost + grid[i][j], length + 1))\n        \n        memo[(i, j)] = paths\n        return paths\n    \n    all_paths = dp(0, 0)\n    max_avg = 0\n    \n    for cost, length in all_paths:\n        avg = cost / length\n        if avg > max_avg:\n            max_avg = avg\n    \n    return max_avg"}
