{"task_id": "Mbpp/799", "solution": "def left_rotate(n, d):\n    \"\"\"Rotate left bits by d positions for a 32-bit number.\"\"\"\n    d = d % 32  # Handle cases where d > 32\n    return ((n << d) | (n >> (32 - d))) & 0xFFFFFFFF"}
